  <ym-title|Atomic response and Coffer transfer><label|atomic-response-and-coffer-transfer>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, selected-scale trace producer.

    <item>Status: draft; the algebraic transfer and its precise source
    interfaces are documented, but the selected atomic response, the
    price-duality recurrence, and the local Served/Vault producer remain open
    dependencies.

    <item>Imported Lean revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/trace-coffer-supplier.tex>.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Source crosswalk><label|source-crosswalk>

  <block|<tformat|<twith|table-width|1par>|<twith|table-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|bottom>|<table|<row|<cell|<strong|Mathematical
  content>>|<cell|<strong|Exact source declarations and
  paths>>|<cell|<strong|Source reading and scope>>>|<row|<cell|Atomic
  coefficient/field/response receipt>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Trace.Shunt.AtomD>,
  <verbatim|YM.Trace.Shunt.voyage>, <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Shunt/Post.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|AtomD>
  carries format, a remainder charge <verbatim|a> with coefficient-size plus
  remainder at most <verbatim|q>, attainment and forced-profile equality, and
  the exact density identity. <verbatim|voyage> is an upstream constructor
  using <verbatim|convert_atom> and <verbatim|platter>; this chapter only
  transfers its receipt.>>|<row|<cell|Public Bill demand and native root
  normalization>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Trace.Terrace.nativeC>,
  <verbatim|YM.Trace.Terrace.Bill>, <verbatim|YM.Trace.Terrace.purchasing>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Terrace/Casa.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|purchasing>
  sets <verbatim|Z=hatBeta(k)>, <verbatim|Y=Z^3>, inflates the field by
  <verbatim|alto(k,d)>, and calls <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.riches>. The
  target native root allowance contains the additional factor
  <verbatim|Z^{-1}>. <verbatim|Bill.root> is the reflection-positive tiling
  root test.>>|<row|<cell|Paid hierarchy data consumed by
  Coffer>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Geyser>,
  <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Freightage>, <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Geyser.at>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Badlands.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|Geyser.aim>
  supplies the common hierarchy/music with top condition, heard coefficients,
  adjacent response receipts, and terminal forced-profile identity.
  <verbatim|Geyser.at> uses this to make the site/box expansion. The producer
  of these inputs is not proved in this unit.>>|<row|<cell|Exact input and
  output of the finite transfer>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.Buff>,
  <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.Melts>, <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.riches>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Soot/Bloom.lean>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Soot/Coffer.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|riches>
  assumes <verbatim|k\<less\>N>, reference level <verbatim|\<leq\>k>, a
  <verbatim|Buff> record, coefficient and forced-budget inequalities,
  <verbatim|Melts 1>, payment inequality, and <verbatim|SharpRead>. It
  returns a label with a column discrepancy and, for every open window
  <verbatim|J\<leq\>m\<less\>k>, room/interiority assumptions, the
  stakes-over-weight root bound. The manuscript records this exact dependency
  boundary.>>|<row|<cell|Backward pair, finite corrections, and dual
  chain>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Extra.Histories.Relay.originate>,
  <verbatim|.eaves>, <verbatim|.antilles>,
  <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.prevails>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Extra/SOURCE_HISTORIES/Counter.lean>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Antilles.lean>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Soot/Skein.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|originate>
  builds the paired endpoint from the input coefficient and primary voice;
  <verbatim|eaves> descends finitely, replacing one solo at each step via the
  response identity; <verbatim|antilles> dualizes at the left coefficient
  coordinate. <verbatim|prevails> specializes the resulting zero-site Woke
  duet to the Coffer endpoint and applies <verbatim|SharpRead>. The
  manuscript cross-references the fully written same-history
  primary-field/zero-coordinate-transition argument in
  <verbatim|sec:reference-difference>, especially
  <verbatim|eq:reference-produced-difference>; that argument assumes its
  bank/column and calibrated-transition receipts.>>|<row|<cell|Price-duality
  recurrence>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Extra.Histories.Relay.SharpRead>,
  <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Quince.pricey>, <verbatim|.ascend>,
  <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Quince.rideE>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Soot/Skein.lean>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Quince/Apace.lean>,
  <verbatim|Pride.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|SharpRead> is precisely the estimate
  of the endpoint voice for a Woke duet with zero point values and
  nonnegative budget. <verbatim|ascend> iterates the one-step estimate
  <verbatim|pricey>; <verbatim|pricey> invokes <verbatim|rideE>,
  <verbatim|tillP>, <verbatim|till_gain>, and <verbatim|spends>. The actual
  producer is assigned to the next chapter, not asserted proved
  here.>>|<row|<cell|Rooted response and gas
  envelopes>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.underS>,
  <verbatim|.copious>, <verbatim|.spiker>,
  <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.Served>, <verbatim|.Vault>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Soot/Thrifty.lean>, <verbatim|Basin.lean>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/South/Block.lean>, <verbatim|Accent.lean>,
  <verbatim|Strudel.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|underS> constructs a
  scale-<verbatim|J> census, couples the negative dual endpoint to the lens
  response, obtains <verbatim|Served>/<verbatim|Vault> from
  <verbatim|copious>, and applies <verbatim|spiker>. The budgets are site
  absolute-sum 2, box absolute-sum 1, and support exponent 1.
  <verbatim|spiker> gives exponent <verbatim|\|\<Lambda\>_m\|
  Treasury(m)+\|V_J\|(2+1+2)>; <verbatim|Stock.spacer> and
  <verbatim|Stock.tallies> convert this to stakes. The local production uses
  occupancy, migration, <verbatim|Melts>, selected hierarchy, Wilson
  transfer, and room/interiority. This unit does not claim those receipts
  from their names alone.>>|<row|<cell|Absolute polynomial price and Wilson
  denominator>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.steer>, <verbatim|.sail>,
  <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.sail>, <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.spiker>,
  <verbatim|YM.Wilson> partition identities;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Newell.lean>, <verbatim|Arbol.lean>,
  <verbatim|South/Block.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|steer> bounds pointwise price
  of the site/box expansion; <verbatim|sail> integrates coefficients and
  divides by the positive Wilson partition using the free-energy/denominator
  estimate. <verbatim|spiker> specializes it to the planted moment. The
  manuscript's exponent bookkeeping is (2+1+2f), with (f=1), and uses
  (>>|<row|<cell|Root test and stake definition>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Cells.Tiling.copy>,
  <verbatim|.rootTest>; <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.stakes>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Cells/Tiling.lean>, <verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Strudel.lean>>|<cell|The
  copy conjugates exactly on odd reflection parity; root test is the norm of
  the copied product moment to the reciprocal number-of-cells power. Stakes
  are <verbatim|exp((A_J/A_m)^4 Treasury(m)+5)>.>>|<row|<cell|Native price
  specialization>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Trace.Terrace.purchasing>,
  <verbatim|.nativeC>, <verbatim|.alto_norm>, <verbatim|.Bill>,
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/TraceExtension/Terrace/Casa.lean>, and
  <verbatim|manuscript/existence/trace-bill-prices.tex>>|<cell|With
  (Z=\\widehat\\beta_k), the source call uses (B=Z^3), (a=v'=Z^{-1}), (e=Z),
  and (zeta_i=\\operatorname{fly}_d(i)). Thus (e
  zeta_k=Z\\operatorname{fly}_d(k)\\leq Z^2=v'B). The Coffer weight has the
  prefactor (a=Z^{-1}), exactly the native Bill denominator; no extra factor
  of (Z) is available or needed. The bias is bounded by (threshold(k)^2
  AgeK_k(-1/4)), as in the Bill statement. The rate bound and column estimate
  are cross-referenced to the separately reviewed native-price unit.>>>>>

  <section|Checks and unresolved items><label|checks-and-unresolved-items>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Read-only source commands actually run: <verbatim|rg -n> and
    <verbatim|sed -n> on the paths and declarations listed in the table,
    including <verbatim|Casa.lean>, <verbatim|Coffer.lean>,
    <verbatim|Skein.lean>, <verbatim|Thrifty.lean>, <verbatim|Basin.lean>,
    <verbatim|Block.lean>, <verbatim|Accent.lean>, <verbatim|Strudel.lean>,
    <verbatim|Badlands.lean>, <verbatim|Antilles.lean>,
    <verbatim|Counter.lean>, <verbatim|Bloom.lean>, <verbatim|Post.lean>,
    <verbatim|Loan.lean>, <verbatim|Arbol.lean>, <verbatim|Apace.lean>,
    <verbatim|Pride.lean>, <verbatim|Geyser>/<verbatim|Freightage>, and
    <verbatim|Cells/Tiling.lean>.

    <item>No Lean file was edited. No Lean or TeX build was run.
    <verbatim|scripts/check_blueprint.py> has not yet been run for this
    evidence file.

    <item>The public construction of the atomic receipt,
    <verbatim|Geyser.aim>/selected hierarchy, the endpoint price-duality
    estimate, the local action and occupancy receipts that produce the
    absolute site/box bounds, and the local Wilson transfer are upstream
    obligations. The displayed scalar transfer does not prove those
    producers.

    <item>The manuscript reorganizes the finite backward pair/dual argument
    and the planted-gas constant conversion. The exact formal theorem
    <verbatim|riches> directly depends on <verbatim|prevails> and
    <verbatim|underS>; <verbatim|underS> directly depends on
    <verbatim|copious> and <verbatim|spiker>. No claim is made that naming
    these declarations supplies their mathematical exposition.
